    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u282",
      "targetTextSha256": "377ef97ce82690c636d3aca0224c9e4271a3557c5624e60d5d0e194b4fa08afe",
      "audioSha256": "3c9487b203d61f94e848853e2483d17c27324a3f41a2a8587cad258934c35bc6",
      "recognized": "那就是死亡的天使要经过整个埃及地，家家户户的长子都要被击杀。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u283",
      "targetTextSha256": "6c40db427e51fcb9230f9cc5e90e33a10b2bf7aeba328d068ab454296476b36f",
      "audioSha256": "49a9995cf672d628a2679ef237de72c0bf2a01f67dc4602bdc3d3d45e32300bd",
      "recognized": "但接着，神对自己的子民说：“嘿，听好了，你们要这样做。”",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u284",
      "targetTextSha256": "90ece5adae34ebd4286b41fc20187d5896c35ac0f7541128020a76b592f89be0",
      "audioSha256": "8f1f0cee101b93a2bf863612be08024d65b8f1d139336e1cdd409e20ba65ccfd",
      "recognized": "你们要取一只羊羔，把羊羔宰了，再取羊羔的血，抹在门框上。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u285",
      "targetTextSha256": "e5c6c66a94dd42618bb2d09b19b930a8b644595d588a549a73e5719f256c3557",
      "audioSha256": "84b0a0f4f85d7812cba17ae7651deffc41661e076072645784e128506d952ef4",
      "recognized": "而门框上高扬的雪将成为一个识别的记号，表明你们属于我，你们是我的。",
      "similarity": 0.9,
      "differences": [
        {
          "kind": "replace",
