        {
          "kind": "replace",
          "expected": [
            "血"
          ],
          "recognized": [
            "雪"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u286",
      "targetTextSha256": "62993e52a425cf4b78d5f75265d427fdd86385f2fc975a5f0fcaa10863b531c1",
      "audioSha256": "c5331ff8d420dfb9adbace6b77737e6125597c005f3e8e0bb58ad19f6ac795bd",
      "recognized": "于是神的子民就照着做了，他们被印记标明，在审判中蒙了保护。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u287",
      "targetTextSha256": "4ac0dfdff1054b7e2bd7ff670a9ceafb30e4e144a2739fca16e2d556269663f0",
      "audioSha256": "5a9480d768cf5c920b5d9b4a72f794b1419ea70e61c6498937a17bf6e1fb4453",
      "recognized": "所以，确实有审判，但神为自己保守他的子民。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u288",
      "targetTextSha256": "071eed8058412aa8135d33ac832e6713f559e423ce5070493a1ed9794bb6ab2b",
      "audioSha256": "e42d95371d5ee28e0ca2f3ee277c5d3738bfb86fe48ff2b65f02a97434843b27",
      "recognized": "而今天在座的我们，我们这些基督徒，我们的门框上并没有羊羔的血。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u289",
      "targetTextSha256": "526a8420cd504965271aee041b5b4667ca39730143969d1dec4b0d9e38e2fca8",
      "audioSha256": "06d3856d201b453a20cf7b8f435f8ea76ef87483ce3269b479b580db8e172587",
      "recognized": "我们有神的羔羊，耶稣基督的血遮盖我们的生命。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u290",
      "targetTextSha256": "73680448e9274cffecc93e1d1b2b9d1d7efd1fb0447347806b8e26510c699450",
      "audioSha256": "a2e20cbcd79cfd0558383f1af70ff987d29999786a711cf537e6f6d0230686c8",
      "recognized": "我们受了印记，是因为耶稣就是那位为我们被杀的羔羊。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
