    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-0-u306",
      "targetTextSha256": "9ad42cec8cd17b86478adaf31b4e2446c0fa99e7b04120d6967ce74c4834f5e8",
      "audioSha256": "76fb4da0ef917ad8525471844acd316d8035d2a7099f9e28776e79dba85bb5fc",
      "recognized": "你们还记得吗？当百姓进入耶利哥，就是神的百姓要去攻打耶利哥的时候，他拿了一条朱红线绳，就是一根红绳子。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
