      "audioSha256": "7ad0d526ff38914e2c7c93a5a007474b4952e6be96809f19bc852d08be2ffb1d",
      "recognized": "并把它从自己的家里挂出来，表明它是属于神的。他已经受了神的印记。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
